{{JPExclusive}}
Castle and Dragon Awakens! is a series of [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]] stages that introduce the [[True Form]]s of [[Castle Guard (Rare Cat)|Castle Guard]], [[Castle Horseman (Rare Cat)|Castle Horseman]], [[Ashura (Rare Cat)|Ashura]], [[Battle Balloon (Rare Cat)|Battle Balloon]], [[Dragon Rider (Rare Cat)|Dragon Rider]], [[Pretty Cat (Rare Cat)|Pretty Cat]], [[Cyclops (Rare Cat)|Cyclops]] and [[Golem (Special Cat)|Golem]].

